The vertex and fragment shader embedded in public/local/cockpit-fluid.js
are adapted from references/canonical-vertex-shader.glsl and
references/canonical-fragment-shader.glsl in the above source revision.

Modifications, 2026-11-21:
- Scoped, dependency-free lifecycle for four commerce dashboard metric cards.
- Capped pixel ratio and frame rate, hidden/offscreen suspension, reduced motion.
- Per-card palettes and pointer interaction, graceful CSS fallback.
- Shader edge fading expressed with ordered smoothstep endpoints.
- Fragment precision follows the browser's supported high precision range.

No upstream author portrait, branding assets, or 3D-card-acrylic code is included.
